# T3Lab Assistant runtime-generated data — machine-local, regenerated on
# first use, and previously leaked developer machine paths/conversation
# content into the repo. See T3Lab.extension/lib/Services/tool_discovery.py
# and Intelligence/t3lab_assistant.py — both handle a missing file gracefully.
T3Lab.extension/lib/config/tool_registry.json
T3Lab.extension/lib/config/learned_patterns.json
T3Lab.extension/lib/config/chat_history/

# Local fine-tune build artifacts (finetune_local.py default --out)
tools/train/out/

# Model Auditor score history is per-user project data: it lives in
# %APPDATA%\T3LabAI\model_auditor\history. The old in-extension folder must
# never be committed again (it exposed client project names, 2026-10-02).
T3Lab.extension/lib/GUI/Resources/ModelAuditorHistory/
